# Juspay - Global Payments Operating System

> Juspay is a global payment orchestration platform processing 300M+ daily transactions at 99.999% uptime, with $1Tn+ annual volume across 40+ countries. It provides full-stack payment orchestration, checkout experience, 3DS authentication, tokenization, analytics, and payout infrastructure for enterprise merchants and banks.

